(6248576, 924090, 54446, '<td valign="top">Superb bh ram.  Good comp, lots of detail and effective narrow DOF.  The monochrome works for me.  My fav in the challenge, so far.  But, I really like BH sheep, especially rams.</td>', 'Superb bh ram.  Good comp, lots of detail and effective narrow DOF.  The monochrome works for me.  My fav in the challenge, so far.  But, I really like BH sheep, especially rams.', '2010-12-08 06:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
