(6248722, 924165, 50618, '<td valign="top">nice interaction between the three.</td>', 'nice interaction between the three.', '2010-12-08 08:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6248895, 923642, 68020, '<td valign="top">Great shot...love the DOF - 8</td>', 'Great shot...love the DOF - 8', '2010-12-08 12:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6248994, 923324, 87318, '<td valign="top">Seems they outside the DOF as you move back into the image.  IMHO would have been best for them all to be in focus, as the blurred background of water adds little/nothing to the image vs. in focus unlike an image with a busy background where this  might be preferred.</td>', 'Seems they outside the DOF as you move back into the image.  IMHO would have been best for them all to be in focus, as the blurred background of water adds little/nothing to the image vs. in focus unlike an image with a busy background where this  might be preferred.', '2010-12-08 13:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6248997, 924043, 87318, '<td valign="top">Nub of an ear on the left side of the image looks kind of like a wart... might have been better to not see it as all (per the portraiture rule of thumb) or to have been able to cleanly tell what it is.  Image appears (on my laptop screen) to be slightly pixelated?  Nice pose and concept.</td>', 'Nub of an ear on the left side of the image looks kind of like a wart... might have been better to not see it as all (per the portraiture rule of thumb) or to have been able to cleanly tell what it is.  Image appears (on my laptop screen) to be slightly pixelated?  Nice pose and concept.', '2010-12-08 13:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6248998, 924090, 112828, '<td valign="top">Oh, very very nice - love those eyes (even if I do think they''re a bit creepy!)..<br/> <br/>Great shot, and SUPERB processing, clearly you are quite good at this. :)</td>', 'Oh, very very nice - love those eyes (even if I do think they''re a bit creepy!).. Great shot, and SUPERB processing, clearly you are quite good at this. :)', '2010-12-08 13:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6249003, 923642, 112828, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice bokeh - skin tones are a little off I think, but it''s really quite nice overall..</td>', 'Wow, nice bokeh - skin tones are a little off I think, but it''s really quite nice overall..', '2010-12-08 13:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6249005, 924279, 112828, '<td valign="top">What a mess!<br/> <br/>Great job of stopping the action here, he certainly seems to be enjoying life..</td>', 'What a mess! Great job of stopping the action here, he certainly seems to be enjoying life..', '2010-12-08 13:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6249012, 924265, 112828, '<td valign="top">While this isn''t a bad image by any means, you have several issues -<br/> <br/><b>Contrast/brightness</b>, the image is a touch low contrast and dark.<br/> <br/><b>Sharpness</b>, you both could have sharpened more and a faster shutter would have benefited the shot, as her hands are blurred from movement...<br/> <br/><b>Subject</b>, I don''t really see this telling me a story or making me ask questions, really, it''s more - why is this here?<br/> <br/>Best of luck!  :)</td>', 'While this isn''t a bad image by any means, you have several issues - Contrast/brightness, the image is a touch low contrast and dark. Sharpness, you both could have sharpened more and a faster shutter would have benefited the shot, as her hands are blurred from movement... Subject, I don''t really see this telling me a story or making me ask questions, really, it''s more - why is this here? Best of luck!  :)', '2010-12-08 13:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6249014, 924234, 112828, '<td valign="top">Let''s see...  Elk, sharply in focus at what looks like 400mm..  I''m gonna bet the bank this is <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=54446" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">hahn23</a>, if not, then Mr. Hahn might have some competition...<br/> <br/>No matter who''s image this is, it''s a very nice shot, well focused and taken fairly close in, incredible detail, and although a small dose of Topaz could have done some wonderful things here, the natural look is also quite nice.<br/> <br/>Darn shame this is basic, I bet that OOF grass spot on his neck bugs you as much as it does me...  But, it''s always super hard to shoot in these conditions and get the focus right, seems the camera always wants to focus on something besides the subject, really a challenge, but that''s one thing that really makes this shine.</td>', 'Let''s see...  Elk, sharply in focus at what looks like 400mm..  I''m gonna bet the bank this is  hahn23, if not, then Mr. Hahn might have some competition... No matter who''s image this is, it''s a very nice shot, well focused and taken fairly close in, incredible detail, and although a small dose of Topaz could have done some wonderful things here, the natural look is also quite nice. Darn shame this is basic, I bet that OOF grass spot on his neck bugs you as much as it does me...  But, it''s always super hard to shoot in these conditions and get the focus right, seems the camera always wants to focus on something besides the subject, really a challenge, but that''s one thing that really makes this shine.', '2010-12-08 13:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6249017, 923785, 112828, '<td valign="top">Long lovely shadows!<br/> <br/>I do like the star bursting of the sun, I''ll have to look at your equipment after this rolls over... :)</td>', 'Long lovely shadows! I do like the star bursting of the sun, I''ll have to look at your equipment after this rolls over... :)', '2010-12-08 13:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6249019, 923564, 112828, '<td valign="top">I think this should have had a shallower DOF to help isolate the subjects..<br/> <br/>Nah, just kidding, this is actually wonderful, you managed to NAIL the DOF on this one, and it really just makes the shot - I hope whoever this kid''s parents are got a shot of this, as it''s just great!</td>', 'I think this should have had a shallower DOF to help isolate the subjects.. Nah, just kidding, this is actually wonderful, you managed to NAIL the DOF on this one, and it really just makes the shot - I hope whoever this kid''s parents are got a shot of this, as it''s just great!', '2010-12-08 13:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6249021, 924282, 119747, '<td valign="top">This would have done much better in motion blur! Nice though, 7</td>', 'This would have done much better in motion blur! Nice though, 7', '2010-12-08 13:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
