(6254433, 924178, 96751, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this is a glitch, but thought you''d like it for posterity:<br/> <br/>Avg (all users): 5.1314<u><b> <br/>Avg (commenters): 10.0000</b></u> <br/>Avg (participants): 4.8065<br/>Avg (non-participants): 5.2014</td>', 'I don''t know if this is a glitch, but thought you''d like it for posterity: Avg (all users): 5.1314 Avg (commenters): 10.0000 Avg (participants): 4.8065Avg (non-participants): 5.2014', '2010-12-15 01:44:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6254435, 924130, 93565, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Julien! Glad to see a teammate garner another ribbon.<br/>Excellent photo, and I can totally relate to your comments about feeling alive in settings like this. You''ve done a wonderful job of depicting that for the viewer, and I know exactly how hard it can be to capture a moment like that for those who weren''t present.</td>', 'Congratulations Julien! Glad to see a teammate garner another ribbon.Excellent photo, and I can totally relate to your comments about feeling alive in settings like this. You''ve done a wonderful job of depicting that for the viewer, and I know exactly how hard it can be to capture a moment like that for those who weren''t present.', '2010-12-15 01:44:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6254437, 924043, 96751, '<td valign="top">I hate when a DQ is due to stupidity.  All of mine have been :-)<br/> <br/>I am also particularly proud to have identified your technique.  With a very unusual and oddly alluring result.</td>', 'I hate when a DQ is due to stupidity.  All of mine have been :-) I am also particularly proud to have identified your technique.  With a very unusual and oddly alluring result.', '2010-12-15 01:46:19.000000', NULL, 0),
