(6254441, 924090, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ursual!!???  I''m SO not used to realism from you.  You are even MORE talented than I originally thought :-)  Congrats on the top 10.</td>', 'Ursual!!???  I''m SO not used to realism from you.  You are even MORE talented than I originally thought :-)  Congrats on the top 10.', '2010-12-15 01:52:01.000000', NULL, 0),
