(6254519, 924043, 102278, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by crayon:</b></div><hr/><i> something about the forehead region of this photo seems distracting, </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>My daughter has got a particularly large forehead. Like the Mekon. I guess the composition with the centrally placed eyes could also have something to do with it though.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-12-15 03:31:54.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by crayon: something about the forehead region of this photo seems distracting,   My daughter has got a particularly large forehead. Like the Mekon. I guess the composition with the centrally placed eyes could also have something to do with it though.', '2010-12-15 03:29:49.000000', '2010-12-15 03:31:54.000000', 0),
(6254521, 924158, 48954, '<td valign="top">He was saved, because I took him in. He was found in the countryside; skin and bones he was. Now he''s healthy and full of life.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-12-16 17:25:57.</i></td>', 'He was saved, because I took him in. He was found in the countryside; skin and bones he was. Now he''s healthy and full of life.', '2010-12-15 03:34:29.000000', '2010-12-16 17:25:57.000000', 0),
