(6254885, 924265, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think the in-challenge comments were pretty accurate. (Except for Grog''s. Why he thought this was a celebrity is a mystery to me!)  The image appears somewhat flat and definitely needs a little cranking up in PP. I tried some of PSP''s clarify on this, and it did help to give it a little pop and dimension. As Cory suggested, some saturation, contrast and sharpening (in addition to some clarify) would certainly help. The composition is a bit static as well. I might have composed this with a little more room at the top and more free space on the left side, to give her something to dance into. As far as the dancing, I agree it''s not obvious she''s dancing, both from the odd position of her arms, and the fact that she''s wearing a coat and hat. Even though she surely was dancing at the time, it is not strongly conveyed by the image.</td>', 'I think the in-challenge comments were pretty accurate. (Except for Grog''s. Why he thought this was a celebrity is a mystery to me!)  The image appears somewhat flat and definitely needs a little cranking up in PP. I tried some of PSP''s clarify on this, and it did help to give it a little pop and dimension. As Cory suggested, some saturation, contrast and sharpening (in addition to some clarify) would certainly help. The composition is a bit static as well. I might have composed this with a little more room at the top and more free space on the left side, to give her something to dance into. As far as the dancing, I agree it''s not obvious she''s dancing, both from the odd position of her arms, and the fact that she''s wearing a coat and hat. Even though she surely was dancing at the time, it is not strongly conveyed by the image.', '2010-12-15 15:05:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6254941, 923251, 26464, '<td valign="top">you had me fooled.</td>', 'you had me fooled.', '2010-12-15 16:34:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6254948, 923564, 33736, '<td valign="top">One of the sweetest (without being too saccharine) Christmas pictures I''ve seen.  What a cutie that kid is!  Congratulations on your Third.</td>', 'One of the sweetest (without being too saccharine) Christmas pictures I''ve seen.  What a cutie that kid is!  Congratulations on your Third.', '2010-12-15 16:53:34.000000', NULL, 0),
