(6255365, 923374, 28742, '<td valign="top">You made the right choice but it suffers a little from the lack of focus and the crop/frame. I still love it though - priceless expressions of the simple joys of youth.</td>', 'You made the right choice but it suffers a little from the lack of focus and the crop/frame. I still love it though - priceless expressions of the simple joys of youth.', '2010-12-16 04:18:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6255367, 923631, 28742, '<td valign="top">Clown haters - ignore them. ;-) The expressions captured are terrific, the colors are awesome. The things that hurt the overall image, IMO are the composition: crowded on the left, sparse on the right and lots of distracting things going on in the background. Great job though - first entry or not. Based on this, I predict great entries from you going forward. :)</td>', 'Clown haters - ignore them. ;-) The expressions captured are terrific, the colors are awesome. The things that hurt the overall image, IMO are the composition: crowded on the left, sparse on the right and lots of distracting things going on in the background. Great job though - first entry or not. Based on this, I predict great entries from you going forward. :)', '2010-12-16 04:23:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(6255368, 924218, 28742, '<td valign="top">I''d make the title "...more precious than gold", but then again have you seen the price of gold lately?? ;-) A lovely image - not the tack-sharp eye candy voters like, but I think it''s lovely.</td>', 'I''d make the title "...more precious than gold", but then again have you seen the price of gold lately?? ;-) A lovely image - not the tack-sharp eye candy voters like, but I think it''s lovely.', '2010-12-16 04:26:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6255418, 923864, 108069, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this. I''m in awe of the focus and detail in what should be focused and detailed, while the surrounding reeds and brush are just blurry, tone-filled ambiance. It''s really an amazing shot. I''d wager the vast majority of photographers would have gotten their AF hung up the foreground brush. Sniper. And the detail in the fur is also incredible. Hell of a lens you''ve got there.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this. I''m in awe of the focus and detail in what should be focused and detailed, while the surrounding reeds and brush are just blurry, tone-filled ambiance. It''s really an amazing shot. I''d wager the vast majority of photographers would have gotten their AF hung up the foreground brush. Sniper. And the detail in the fur is also incredible. Hell of a lens you''ve got there.', '2010-12-16 07:14:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(6255438, 923374, 15711, '<td valign="top">Kids and snow go together like peanut butter and jelly.  I love their happy faces. :)</td>', 'Kids and snow go together like peanut butter and jelly.  I love their happy faces. :)', '2010-12-16 08:32:15.000000', NULL, 0),
