(6256936, 923564, 61654, '<td valign="top">Just so y''all know, I have the original RAW file, but when I sent it to them for validation, I sent the converted unedited JPG and not the RAW file.  I never check the email that I signed up to DPC with, so when they informed me that I needed to submit the out of the camera CR2 file, I never saw the email and as a result didn''t rectify the situation.  Very sad about this.  It''s been about a year since I had entered anything, so it never occurred to me that submitting the jpg was wrong.  <br/> <br/>Thank you all for all the lovely comments.  I truly appreciate it.</td>', 'Just so y''all know, I have the original RAW file, but when I sent it to them for validation, I sent the converted unedited JPG and not the RAW file.  I never check the email that I signed up to DPC with, so when they informed me that I needed to submit the out of the camera CR2 file, I never saw the email and as a result didn''t rectify the situation.  Very sad about this.  It''s been about a year since I had entered anything, so it never occurred to me that submitting the jpg was wrong.   Thank you all for all the lovely comments.  I truly appreciate it.', '2010-12-18 17:08:08.000000', NULL, 0),
